      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Three Bedroom Homes\r\n\r\nThe three-bedroom homes at Mercer's Court have been thoughtfully designed to offer stylish, spacious living for modern lifestyles. Extending from 126 sq.m (1,356 sq.ft.), these beautifully crafted homes provide generous accommodation with bright, open-plan living areas, well-proportioned bedrooms and carefully considered layouts that maximise both space and natural light.\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-time buyers, growing families and those looking to right-size without compromising on quality, each home has been finished to a high specification with an emphasis on comfort, energy efficiency and contemporary design. The seamless flow between living, dining and kitchen spaces creates the perfect setting for everyday family life as well as entertaining guests.\r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Rathcoole Village, these exceptional homes combine the convenience of a vibrant village location with the benefits of a peaceful boutique development of just 11 residences. With excellent local amenities, schools, parks and transport links all within easy reach, the three-bedroom homes at Mercer's Court offer an outstanding opportunity to enjoy modern living in one of South Dublin's most established and well-connected communities.\r\n\r\nFor further information please contact Savills New Homes on (01) 618 1300 or register your interest on www.mercerscourt.ie"
      },
